    ALL STEPS, PER STEP. Play At Custom FPS shows its FPS box on the same row while
    ticked. Interrupt Others shows STOP/COMPLETE and REPORT/SILENT only while ticked,
    and REPORT/SILENT only matters on COMPLETE. No label is clipped. The mode dropdown's
    tooltip lists only the modes it offers.
