  m_text: <b>Expect:</b> Pasted animations are named 'Show 2' and 'Show 3' (names
    stay unique). The pasted Show still has its Pop clip and still spins Pinned.
    A step pasted under a WITH step joins its group (reads WITH). The menu has one
    divider above the tool's entries, not two.
