  m_text: "<b>Expect:</b> Headers read like 'AFTER [self] (Scale) 0.3s Out Quad'.
    The long path is shortened from the front ('\u2026/HoverHighlight'), with the
    full path on hover. Sound, Set Active and punch steps show no ease. The Canvas
    Group Alpha step ends in a warning sign: Self Box has no Canvas Group."
