  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: I6
  Title: Duplicate as Mirrored
  Summary: 'Open: switch the panel on, fade it in, then slide three rows in, staggered
    0.1 s, all with Out Cubic.'
  Watch: this tile's player, Panel
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1092397674}
  - {fileID: 293300713}
  HowTo: "Right-click Open \u2192 <b>Duplicate as Mirrored</b>. Read 'Open Mirrored',
    then preview Open and then Open Mirrored. Undo afterwards. Then right-click one
    slide step \u2192 Mirror Step, and Undo."
  Expect: 'Open Mirrored runs in reverse: the rows slide out first - Three, then
    Two, then One (the delays are flipped: Three 0, Two 0.1, One 0.2), each from
    rest to -300 - then the panel fades to 0, then Set Active switches it off. From
    and To are swapped; every ease is still Out Cubic. No warning in the Console.
    Mirror Step flips just that one step.'
  Needs: 5
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 300
