  Code: I10
  Title: Editing two players at once
  Summary: Two players with the same layout, selected together.
  Watch: Left, Right
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 107227312}
  - {fileID: 1108130011}
  HowTo: Select Left and Right together (Ctrl+click). Change Pop's punch Duration.
    Look for Pop Out. Look at the Scene view.
  Expect: The change goes into both players. There is no Pop Out button while two
    are selected. No errors appear in the Console while the Scene view repaints.
