  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: I9
  Title: The pop-out window
  Summary: Pop Out opens one animation in a window of its own that stays whatever
    you select.
  Watch: this tile's player, Box
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1940648888}
  - {fileID: 1448029640}
  HowTo: Press Pop Out on Second. Select something else, then this tile again. Rename
    Second in the window to Turn. Drag First below Turn in the Inspector. Delete
    Turn from the Inspector, then Undo. Close the window.
  Expect: The Inspector shows Second as one line with a Focus button. The window
    keeps showing it whatever is selected. Renamed or moved, it still finds it. Deleted,
    it says it's gone; after Undo it finds it again. Play in the window keeps playing
    while you select other things; closing the window stops and restores it.
  Needs: 37
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 260
  Header: {fileID: 1670399013}
  Stage: {fileID: 1629638474}
